---   F5 : Separate audio
---   F7 : toggle service mode ON/OFF
---   F8 : toggle 15KHz/31kHz
-
---   RIGHT arrow : move right
---   LEFT  arrow : move left
---   UP    arrow : move up
---   DOWN  arrow : move down
